  "body": "Handling of program's CLI flags is a concern that cross-cuts across various consuming environments (NixOS, Home Manager, nix-darwin, ...), as explored in <https://github.com/Lassulus/wrappers>, so given its package-specific nature would seem like a good fit for nixpkgs' package modules.\n\nA likely first candidate to consume this might be modular services, which explored nix-idiomatic use of CLI flags at #546008.\n",
